  "schema": "vega/page-matrix@1",
  "description": "The page fixture matrix (BUILD-PLAN W15; D4 §17.4 with R-F9's corrections): 35 cases, each a tiny real network built by the backend's own package and explained in-process through D3's inspector, written by make_page_fixtures.py, served by serve_page_fixture.py under the real routes and driven by smoke_page.py --fixture. `zoo` names the inspection zoo's admission cell (vega-forge/scripts/tests/test_inspect_zoo.py) whose composition, task, loss and metrics the case starts from; `edits` are the changes the case makes to it (make_page_fixtures.EDITS); `family` and `blocks` replace the family name and the blocks of a user-defined case. `expect` is the lane the page must read from the network (lane cross-check) and `covers` what the case is in the matrix for. `monitor` ships a monitor reference, so that POST /v1/monitor is answered by the serving templates' Monitor and route body and the many-at-once view reads drift readings; `briefs` ships stub stage briefs the code notes link, so that P-LINKS fetches one.",
